  "description": "FAZA 9 (Ops & Observability) — Edge (Cloudflare Workers) view: gateway WAF blocks by rule, rate-limit hits (429s), cache hit ratio and cache events by state, requests per module, HLS traffic, p95 latency per route (top 10) and 5xx/error volume per module. All series are animaxia_edge_* metrics from the metric contract (animaxia-ops/metrics/METRICS.md §2) — see dashboards/README.md §edge for the two supported ingestion options (authenticated exporter vs Cloudflare GraphQL Analytics).",
