    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "animaxia-prom"
      },
      "description": "Gateway WAF blocks in the last 15m per rule: bot, sqli, xss, traversal, null-byte, query-size. More than 50 blocks / 15m fires AnimaxiaEdgeWafBlocksSpike (warning, runbook edge-waf-misconfig.md) — either an attack or a rule eating legitimate traffic.",
